### 12. Changer le mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "User123!",
  "newPassword": "NewUser123!"
}

###

### 13. Demande de réinitialisation de mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password-request
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user1@techcorp.com"
}

###
@reset_token = 22035e1be9451805ee5fcf79d1087d3a58818d9b61c9efef25cc2ef2f78aafa9
### 14. Réinitialisation de mot de passe (avec token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "{{reset_token}}",
  "newPassword": "ResetUser123!"
}

###

### 15. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

